{
 "chart_notes": [
  "life insurer (J-GAAP 生命保険業 format).",
  "premiums is 保険料等収入 (insurance premiums and other, incl. reinsurance income), as filed.",
  "claims is 保険金等支払金 (claims, annuities, benefits and surrender payments PAID); the change in reserves is the separate line reserve_change.",
  "reserve_change = reserve_provision (責任準備金等繰入額, in 経常費用) - reserve_reversal (責任準備金等戻入額, in 経常収益). Because a reversal sits inside total_revenue, use reserve_provision, not reserve_change, when building up total_expenses.",
  "investment_income is 資産運用収益, gross and incl. realised gains; investment_expenses (資産運用費用) is the matching expense line.",
  "opex is derived: 経常費用 - claims - reserve_provision - investment_expenses. It holds 事業費 (admin_expenses) and その他経常費用.",
  "policyholder_dividend_provision (契約者配当準備金繰入額) is below extraordinary items, outside total_expenses, unlike US policyholder dividends.",
  "pretax_income = 経常利益 + extraordinary items - policyholder_dividend_provision.",
  "policy_reserves is the filed total 保険契約準備金 (支払備金 + 責任準備金 + 契約者配当準備金); future_policy_benefits, policyholder_account_balances and unearned_premiums are not split out in J-GAAP and stay empty.",
  "cash is 現金及び預貯金; the cash flow statement ends on 現金及び現金同等物. The tie-out uses the filing's own reconciliation note only if it foots, else flags.",
  "equity_parent is derived (株主資本 + その他の包括利益累計額)."
 ],
